DESCRIPTION >
    Dashboard overview: offline-conversion funnel stage breakdown (count +
    revenue) for a caller-supplied UTC-padded window intersected with a
    timezone-local day range (Promise.all batch). Tenant-scoped; prunes via
    (site_id, timestamp). Faithful 1:1 port of api/routes/dashboard.js:80-97
    (queryName 'dash_stages'). Typed-column translation (SCOPE_v3.md §2.6):
    properties.site_id -> site_id, event -> event_type,
    properties.ingestion_method -> ingestion_method (typed, LowCardinality
    String NOT NULL), properties.conversion_type -> conversion_type (typed,
    DEFAULT 'untyped'), properties.conversion_value -> conversion_value
    (typed Float64 DEFAULT 0, NOT Nullable).
    REAL TRANSLATION ISSUE, caught by parity validation (not a blind copy):
    the live query wraps in toFloatOrZero(toString(...)) -- toFloatOrZero
    is PostHog HogQL sugar, not a native ClickHouse function; running it
    verbatim against Tinybird's own ClickHouse (tb --cloud sql) fails with
    "Unknown function toFloatOrZero". Translated to the equivalent native
    function toFloat64OrZero, keeping the toString(...) wrap (redundant
    against the already-Float64 column but harmless) since only the function
    name is invalid, not the expression shape. No JSON-bag fields.
    The live query interpolates 4 date-boundary values (built from
    currentPadded.from/to + ' 00:00:00'/' 23:59:59', and localDateFrom/To +
    ' 00:00:00'/' 23:59:59') plus tz directly into the SQL string; per
    doctor_token_verify.pipe's precedent (no raw interpolation of non-tenant
    runtime values), these are ported as required template params carrying
    the full boundary string as the caller already builds it
    (current_from_ts, current_to_ts, tz, local_from_ts, local_to_ts) rather
    than string-interpolated or re-concatenated inside the pipe.
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

TOKEN "st_endpoint_read" READ

NODE dash_stages_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        conversion_type AS stage,
        count() AS count,
        SUM(toFloat64OrZero(toString(conversion_value))) AS revenue
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND event_type = '$conversion'
      AND ingestion_method = 'offline'
      AND conversion_type IN ('lead_created', 'qualified', 'opportunity', 'closed_won')
      AND timestamp >= toDateTime({{ String(current_from_ts, required=True) }})
      AND timestamp <= toDateTime({{ String(current_to_ts, required=True) }})
      AND toTimeZone(timestamp, {{ String(tz, required=True) }}) >= toDateTime({{ String(local_from_ts, required=True) }})
      AND toTimeZone(timestamp, {{ String(tz, required=True) }}) <= toDateTime({{ String(local_to_ts, required=True) }})
    GROUP BY stage
    ORDER BY count DESC
    LIMIT 100

TYPE endpoint
